# Custom themes

Copy a JSON file from the parent `themes` folder here, choose a lowercase filename
(for example `my-theme.json`), and edit its label and colors. Use **Reload theme files**
in this pack’s ComfyUI settings, then select it under **Node design**.

A file here with the same name as a bundled theme overrides it. User themes are not
tracked or overwritten by updates. See [the theme guide](../../Readme/Node_Design.md).
